        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSF830, Solid Brass 8\" Floor Mounted Door Bumper with Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith an 8 Inch height, this floor mounted door stop is great for use on doors that open up to a step down such as patio and porch doors. The 8 Inch Floor Mounted Door Stop with Hook is available in oil rubbed bronze,  satin nickel, polished brass or polished chrome finishes. The hook allows you to prop the door open when desired. The package includes fasteners for wood or concrete installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSF830-specifications.gif?v=1704354746\" width\"323\" height=\"326\" border=\"0\" alt=\"8 Inch Floor Mount Door Bumper Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/8-inch-tall-door-stop-deltana-dsf800\"><b>Deltana DSF800 8 Inch Tall Door Stop</b></a>\r\nand <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DSF830 8 Inch Tall Door Stop:\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection of the Rubber Bumper: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSF830-specifications.pdf?v=1704262318\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSF830 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
