                "description": "Deltana DSF830, 8 Inch Floor Mounted Door Stop - With an 8 Inch height, this floor mounted door stop is great for use on doors that open up to a step down such as patio and porch doors. The 8 Inch Floor Mounted Door Stop with Hook is available in oil rubbed bronze,  satin nickel, polished brass or polished chrome finishes. The hook allows you to prop the door open when desired. The package includes fasteners for wood or concrete installation.",
